WEBVTT

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:14.540
Nationally, the people in charge had a so-called collective identity.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:19.910
The citizens, on the other hand,

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.210
lost all their properties and assets as a result of this incident.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.350
Thus, the amount of crime and sin
that occurred went down in history.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.690
The Third Division brought about

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.180
ruin... and destruction.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.270
The evil engendered by the destruction was divided into two different colors.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.740
And that was all that was left of Japan.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:01.340
The district painted in neither color was called Toshima.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:13.360
So, what color will it end up being dyed in?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.880
I am lost in my thought as the days pass me by

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.880
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.020
No one has yet to realize my madness

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.020
Daremo Kidukanai Kurai

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:07.040
The crimson liquid trails down my goosey skin

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:07.040
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.230
Why do you wish for another punishment?

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.230
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.980
These sweet scents floating with "blood"

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.980
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:20.540
Let the fragrances idle and drift about freely as I hoped they would

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:20.540
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:28.220
Now please, hurry and pierce through me!

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:28.220
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:33.370
Shoot me and put visible holes through my body

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:33.370
Shoot me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.840
Squeeze the thorny pistol grip,

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.840
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubuse

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.610
load the bullets that resemble red rosebuds,

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.610
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:47.720
and let me shoot through the flower!

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:47.720
Let me shoot through the flower!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.160
Smear this world in rose!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.160
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:12.640
Get 'em, Lost!

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.820
You'll definitely set a new record, ya know!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.050
Do him in!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:40.940
Knock him out!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:42.850
You bastard--!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.490
Lost is the man!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.570
Lost!!!

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.540
Akira!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.790
You were in perfect shape again today!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.580
It was a piece of cake, right?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:06.490
That's right.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.880
Was it really just that?

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.310
Aren't you at least a little happy about this?

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.120
It wasn't that big of a deal.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.660
It was the same old crap.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.440
You always say that.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.260
Enough of that. What're you gonna do now?

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:19.690
You're gonna go drinking with us, right?

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.310
We'll bring over a good number of your fanboys!

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:24.270
Nah, I'll pass today.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.310
Bah, again?!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.360
Man, you've got piss poor social skills.

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:29.820
Later.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:36.800
Akira!

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:38.870
Keisuke.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.340
Good work, Akira!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.570
Yeah, thanks.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.550
You're really not going drinking with everyone else?

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.520
That's right. I want to rest up as soon as I can.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.610
Oh yeah, you're worn out now, huh?

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:55.260
Go ahead and rest up nice and easy.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:58.680
Akira!

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.220
Erm, mind if I swing by your place later?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.050
I'll bring something for you to eat, okay?

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.190
Aren't those solids you always eat getting tasteless?

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:10.900
Yeah, okay.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.340
See ya, then.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.740
Yup, I'll see ya later!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.120
We're cops. Follow our orders.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.750
What do you want with me?

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:53.500
Well well, you have some arrogant eyes.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.980
You remember this guy, don't you?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.380
Don't know him.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.200
Well, he died.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.090
To be precise, someone killed him.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.410
And you happen to be the prime suspect.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.600
Akira? I'm letting myself in.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:37.880
Take that!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.350
Just confess already!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.350
Now the Perfect Emperor Lost has fallen to the realm of mortals.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.710
Bet you never thought you'd die in the same way you killed someone else.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:50.390
If you try to resist, your crimes will only continue to add up.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:59.670
Citizenship Number: 11248-TM-3099. Unemployed.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:02.010
No family members besides your parents.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.790
After living with them in their house for three years, you cut ties with them.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:09.960
And you were in the championship of the Individual Bl@ster Matches?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.680
Living apart from them, huh?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.790
Weren't they nice, loving parents?

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:19.490
Why ever did you bother to leave your house?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.010
Your charges will be announced at 3 PM.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:25.280
The cause of the victim's death was diagnosed

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.230
as death by traumatic shock due to his body being hit multiple times.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:33.690
You have no alibi, you're skilled, you're strong, and you were near the scene of the crime.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.650
I can't think of any Bl@ster regular other than you.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.470
I didn't do it.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.710
Quit lying!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.030
You did it!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:49.450
You damned mad, rabid dog!

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.700
Go take him away.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.410
Yes, sir.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.180
Hey now. Hurry and walk already!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.300
What happened to your vigor from earlier, eh?!

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.690
Even if you die,

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.520
you'll still have to serve your sentence and deal with the circumstances!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.450
Charged with murder?

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.310
You've gotta be fucking kidding me!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.350
Those are false accusations!

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.680
Am I really going to be stuck here for the rest of my life?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.840
Get out. You have a visitor.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.620
A visitor?

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.350
Who are you?

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.940
Let's cut to the chase.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:02.060
Right now, the probability of your charges being lifted is zero.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.230
I am Emma.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.650
And he is Gwen.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:13.740
We'd like you to think of us as being unimportant.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.420
Do you know of the fate of those who are charged with murder?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.710
It's life imprisonment, right?

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.260
That's right.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.050
Naturally, you would be aware of the
dread and terror that encompasses, right?

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.610
When it comes to murder, no matter what conditions and circumstances there are,

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:29.850
the compensation is a life behind bars.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:33.810
To take someone's life is to subject yourself to torture.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:39.390
And given your attitude, that torture will follow you to the grave.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.520
But it wasn't me.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:47.030
Even if you continue to insist and claim that you're innocent and you pass the verdict of the courtroom,

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:47.950
you'll hit a dead end.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.490
Well, listen up.

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:58.480
To say the least, we did not come all the way over here to listen to your last words.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:00.960
You can still get out of here.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.970
But we do have our own conditions you'd have to accept.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.690
Conditions?

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.060
Do you know about Toshima?

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.870
After the Third Division incident,

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:16.970
the gap between the CFC and the Japanese Revival Party got wider, and Toshima became a lawless district.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.880
If you wish to reclaim your
freedom, you should go to Toshima.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.060
Then, I will have you participate in Igra.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:27.110
The game play is more mature than that of Bl@ster.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:30.050
Igra, itself, is a genuine massacre game.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.240
These would prove that you're participating in Igra.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.640
All you have to do is take tags like these from other participants.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.010
By force.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.710
What's the end-goal?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.240
To aim for being Igra's flawless king.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.850
Defeat Il re.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.210
Why's that?

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.060
If you are able to overthrow the king,

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.260
that will lead to the annihilation of the drug company, Vischio.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.940
That's what we wish to see.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.110
That being said, you can either let your one life end here or rise up as the top of Igra.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.610
It's your choice.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:10.030
I won't coerce you.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.150
The right to choose is in your hands.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.500
I have no choice but to participate, don't I?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.040
Then our negotiations have concluded.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:29.280
Well then, shall I prepare for you to go back to your home?

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.850
By the way, don't try to think of a way out of this. It's for your own good.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.840
The inspectors and guards are always able to catch people.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:01.790
Akira?!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.060
What a relief, Akira!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.180
I was wondering where you went!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.240
Were you waiting for me here the whole time?

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.030
Yes.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.610
Could you please refrain from unnecessary contact?

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:14.630
What's with you?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.090
That is something that is not necessary for you to know.

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:18.300
Go away!

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.160
Don't get in the way.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.920
That would be my line.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.710
This may be my last time here.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.810
It should be fair to spare me some time to say my good byes, right?

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:29.720
Fine.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.730
We'll give you just ten minutes.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.380
I got it.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.070
Come with me, Keisuke.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.830
Hold up, can't you just talk here?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:45.360
What if there's something that I want to do that I can't do here?

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.160
What?!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.290
Go then.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.700
Let's go, Keisuke.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.260
A-Akira?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.500
What the hell is with that?

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.140
That's pure cowardice!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.900
I can't believe you were forced to go to Toshima...

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.650
Isn't it just like telling you to go die?!

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:14.240
If I were to refuse, I'd be in jail for life.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.930
It wouldn't change my situation dramatically.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.180
No way!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.520
That accusation is pure bullshit, isn't it?!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.280
So why are you--

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:22.380
Is there really nothing else you can do?!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.950
I've made up my mind.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.750
It doesn't have anything to do with you.

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:31.420
I think it'd be pointless for me to try to stop you...

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:35.210
But I just don't want it to be this way!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:42.530
All I need to do is collect these tags quickly and fight against that Il re or whoever and beat him.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.440
Yeah, you're really strong.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.740
Time's up.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:52.640
See you.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:54.300
Akira!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.410
Akira!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.140
Akira...!

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.470
Take this with you.

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:24.620
Everything that you'll need is in there.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.990
This is as far as we will guide you.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:50.030
If you go straight ahead from here, you'll reach Toshima.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.160
After, you need to figure out what you need to do by yourself.

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:49.260
Would you happen to be looking for something, bro?

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:02.340
I've never seen your face around here before.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.590
Hand 'em tags over!

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.880
If you do that, we won't hurt ya.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:13.970
Hey, we told you to hand 'em over!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:16.560
You damned--!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.700
What, another sitting duck?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.560
That hurt.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.050
Go and get him already! I'll just watch.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.220
All right.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:43.290
I'll kill you, asshole.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:44.960
Take that!

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.870
Don't look down on me!

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.600
I wanna turn too!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:27.760
What the hell is with you?!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:31.510
Huh?

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.550
What trash.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.090
Please forgive me!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.810
If it's tags you want, I'll give 'em to you!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.010
Here!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.800
Okay...?

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.830
Do you want to die too?

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:40.870
Don't screw with me!

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.350
Let me see you beg for your life just once.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:53.970
I don't want to!

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:09.440
Those eyes of yours are most intriguing.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.080
Trash always grovels on the roadside.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:49.240
So this is Toshima...

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.930
I've been crying

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.080
towards the irrational sky

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.080
Rifujin-na Sora ni

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:17.200
Hate my fate

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:20.050
As my struggles seem to continue,

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:20.050
Mogaki Tsudukete

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.520
I decided

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:28.170
to reel in and collect these frail threads

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:28.170
Zeijaku-na Ito ga Taguri Yoseru

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:33.340
Recklessly, I run towards tomorrow

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:33.340
Ashita e Yamikumo ni Hashiru

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.400
Through the dark,

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.400
Through the dark

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:38.670
my steps are busy

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:38.670
Ashimoto wa busy

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:43.740
For days, I remain lost in a broken world

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:43.740
Hibi Wareta Sekai ni Madou

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:53.860
All that I can believe in is anguish

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:53.860
Shinjirareru Mono wa Tada Itami Dake

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:57.750
That very belief should be just over that way

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:57.750
Sono Saki ni Aru Hazu no

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.270
together with the light

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.270
Hikari e to

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:04.210
The contending sadness is now of my faith

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:04.210
Ubaiau Kanashimi no my faith

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:09.720
Even if my heart feels like it's been gouged out,

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:09.720
Tatoe Kokoro ga Egurareyou to

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:18.620
I don't stop my feet as I try to return back

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:18.620
Ashi wo Tomezu ni Kurimodoshitai yo

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:52.730
Reprimanded Dog

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:54.340
Welcome to Toshima!

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:57.410
What, did it end already?! Where was my scene?!

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.520
No one even bothered to call us this time, eh?!

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.860
That's cause no one wants to see some old geezer!

00:24:03.860 --> 00:24:04.810
Hey, damn you!

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:06.350
Oh, hey, take a look!

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:09.660
Looks like some frisky kittens are coming now!

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:12.740
One type of cute kitten is right there!

00:24:12.740 --> 00:24:14.310
It's a weird one.

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:16.770
How many should there be for the grand welcoming...

00:24:14.710 --> 00:24:19.750
Episode 2

00:24:16.770 --> 00:24:19.710
Ah, they look so tasty!
